segment.source:
::You grab the flask from his trembling hand and dangle it in front of a pair of horrified eyes.::

WAIT!

::As you shove the flask into his mouth and let the liquid flow, his pupils begin to whirl like a pair of drunken flies; his arms - flailing them around helplessly. He tries to speak, but all you hear is gurgling, and by doing just that he is ejecting some of the liquid from his mouth and getting it all over himself. For the most part, though, the green juice of mystery reaches its intended destination.::&lt;end&gt;

